<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{.Locale}}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Certificate of Authenticity — {{.Code}}</title>
<style>
  @page { margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: "Noto Serif", "Songti SC", "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .page {
    width: 210mm; height: 297mm; /* A4 */
    padding: 28mm 24mm;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .crest {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14pt;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #4a7c6f; /* celadon */
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #4a7c6f;
    padding-bottom: 8mm;
    margin-bottom: 14mm;
  }
  .title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 26pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 6mm 0 2mm;
  }
  .subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11pt;
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 16mm;
  }
  .field {
    margin: 4mm 0;
    font-size: 12pt;
  }
  .field .label {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 9pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 1mm;
  }
  .field .value {
    font-size: 13pt;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .body {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
    margin: 8mm 0;
  }
  .seal {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 10mm;
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
  .qr img { width: 28mm; height: 28mm; }
  .verify {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: #777;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .verify .url { color: #4a7c6f; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="crest">Jingdezhen Ceramics</div>

  <div class="title">Certificate of Authenticity</div>
  <div class="subtitle">This document certifies the provenance of an original work</div>

  <div class="field">
    <div class="label">Certificate Code</div>
    <div class="value">{{.Code}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <div class="label">Work</div>
    <div class="value">{{.ProductTitle}}</div>
  </div>
  {{if .ArtistName}}
  <div class="field">
    <div class="label">Artist</div>
    <div class="value">{{.ArtistName}}</div>
  </div>
  {{end}}
  <div class="field">
    <div class="label">Issued</div>
    <div class="value">{{.IssuedAt.Format "2 January 2006"}}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="body">
    This certificate, identified by the code above, attests that the accompanying
    work is an authentic piece of Jingdezhen ceramic art. Scan the code to view
    the full provenance record, including creation and sale history, on the
    Jingdezhen Ceramics platform.
  </div>

  <div class="seal">
    <div class="qr">
      <img src="{{.QRURL}}" alt="Certificate QR code" />
    </div>
    <div class="verify">
      Verify online at<br>
      <span class="url">{{.PublicURL}}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
